  - All DateTime properties mapped to `datetime2` SQL type
  - Table-per-Hierarchy (TPH) inheritance for Person with discriminator "Discriminator"
    - `Student` → discriminator value "Student"
    - `Instructor` → discriminator value "Instructor"
  - Composite key for CourseAssignment: `(CourseID, InstructorID)`
  - One-to-many: Course ↔ CourseAssignment
